  "label": "Juxtaposition Trope",
  "description": "The meme uses the trope of juxtaposition — placing two contrasting elements (innocent baby vs. violent threat) side by side to create a jarring effect. This trope is common in internet culture and requires understanding of how visual and textual elements are combined to create meaning or emotional impact. The contrast is meant to shock the viewer and emphasize the suddenness or irrationality of the threat.",
